Tar (Jacques Supcik) - a tar archive as a document: the list of its files, to extract some or all

  Desktops.OpenDoc Archive.tar (Tar.NewDoc)    the archive as a document
  Tar.Extract, Tar.ExtractAll                   (in its menu) the selected files, or all

polpo's console has its own tar (portia.Install tar) for making archives.
